    "slug when a comarca is drawn as more than one shape (exclaves, second islands).",
    "Source ids that are absent here are dropped by scripts/build_comarca_map.py: the",
    "background rect, the decorative separator and every Aragonese comarca outside the",
    "Franja de Ponent. Entries are sorted by region, then slug, then source id.",
    "Run `python scripts/build_comarca_map.py` after editing."
